    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Converts physical quantities while preserving units and dimensional consistency.",
      "Transforms celestial coordinates between ICRS, Galactic, FK5, and observer-dependent frames.",
      "Guides reading, writing, inspecting, and modifying FITS images and tables.",
      "Calculates cosmological distances, ages, lookback times, and density parameters.",
      "Handles astronomical time formats, scales, arithmetic, and light-travel corrections.",
      "Supports table operations, catalog matching, WCS transformations, visualization, modeling, and statistics."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Requires Python and Astropy to run generated workflows.",
      "Remote object resolution and data downloads require network access.",
      "Results depend on correct frames, units, time scales, locations, and cosmological models.",
      "The skill provides guidance and examples but does not include executable scripts or datasets."
    ],
